 258:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/ip4_addr.c **** /**
 259:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/ip4_addr.c ****  * Convert numeric IP address into decimal dotted ASCII representation.
 260:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/ip4_addr.c ****  * returns ptr to static buffer; not reentrant!
 261:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/ip4_addr.c ****  *
 262:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/ip4_addr.c ****  * @param addr ip address in network order to convert
